{
  "sourceLanguage": "sv",
  "strings": {
    "%lld steg": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld steps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld/%lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld/%lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Skaffa ett utvecklarkonto": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. Get a developer account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Skapa en nyckel": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. Create a key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Koppla nyckeln": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. Connect the key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI-tjänsten svarar inte just nu. Försök igen om en stund.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The AI service is not answering right now. Try again in a while."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alla appar": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All apps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allt är inte ifyllt än.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not everything is filled in yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ange en giltig e-postadress och ett lösenord på minst 8 tecken.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter a valid email address and a password of at least 8 characters."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App Dance": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App Dance"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App Dance visar dem": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App Dance shows them"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App Store": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App Store"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appar att skapa i App Store Connect": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apps to create in App Store Connect"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen behöver läggas upp hos Apple av den som driver tjänsten. Det görs för hand, så det kan ta en stund. Du behöver inte göra något.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app has to be set up with Apple by whoever runs the service. That is done by hand, so it can take a while. You do not need to do anything."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen finns i TestFlight om några minuter": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app is in TestFlight in a few minutes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen finns inte i App Store Connect än. Gör den installerbar först; då får du hjälp att skapa den.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app does not exist in App Store Connect yet. Make it installable first; that walks you through creating it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen finns inte i App Store Connect än. Skapa en ny app där med bundle-id %@ och försök sedan igen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app does not exist in App Store Connect yet. Create a new app there with the bundle ID %@ and then try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen går inte att bygga just nu. Be om en rättning i chatten och försök igen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app cannot be built right now. Ask for a fix in the chat and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen har ingen version som väntar på att skickas in. Den kan redan vara inskickad.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app has no version waiting to be submitted. It may already have been submitted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen hittades inte.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app was not found."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen innehåller inget av det Apple frågar om för åldersgränsen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app has none of the content Apple asks about for the age rating"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen ska vara gratis och finnas i alla länder": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app should be free and available in every country"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen skickas nu in till Apple för granskning, i utvecklarkontots namn.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app is now submitted to Apple for review, in the developer account's name."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen visar inget material från andra som jag saknar rätt att använda": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app shows no material from others that I lack the rights to use"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen är för stor för att skriva ett förslag i ett steg.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app is too large to write a suggestion in one step."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen är inskickad för granskning. Apple hör av sig till kontaktpersonen, oftast inom ett par dagar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app has been submitted for review. Apple gets in touch with the contact person, usually within a couple of days."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen är inte uppladdad än.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app has not been uploaded yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen är inte uppladdad än. Gör den installerbar först, så finns det ett bygge att välja.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app has not been uploaded yet. Make it installable first, so there is a build to select."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen är uppdaterad": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app is updated"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appens skärm i simulatorn": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app's screen in the simulator"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appens version granskas eller är redan släppt, så sidan kan inte ändras härifrån.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app's version is in review or already released, so the page cannot be changed from here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appikon": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App icon"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple bearbetar fortfarande bygget %@. Skicka sidan igen om några minuter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple is still processing build %@. Send the page again in a few minutes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple godkände inte allt på sidan: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple did not accept everything on the page: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple godkände inte appen för test. Den som driver tjänsten har fått veta varför.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple did not approve the app for testing. Whoever runs the service has been told why."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple godkände inte nyckeln. Kontrollera App Store Connect-nyckeln.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple did not accept the key. Check the App Store Connect key."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple godkände inte nyckeln. Kontrollera att Key ID och Issuer ID hör till just den här filen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple did not accept the key. Check that the Key ID and Issuer ID belong to this very file."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple godkände inte nyckeln. Kontrollera kopplingen till utvecklarkontot.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple did not accept the key. Check the connection to the developer account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple går igenom appen innan länken får användas. Första gången kan det ta upp till ett par dagar; nya versioner går fortare.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple looks the app over before the link may be used. The first time that can take up to a couple of days; new versions go faster."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple har skickat en inbjudan till %@. Öppna mejlet och tacka ja. Sedan kommer appen till TestFlight inom några minuter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple has sent an invitation to %@. Open the email and accept. The app then reaches TestFlight within a few minutes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple hör av sig till den här personen om något är oklart. Uppgifterna används för alla dina appar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple gets in touch with this person if something is unclear. The details are used for all your apps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple kräver att varje app har en supportsida och en integritetspolicy på webben.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple requires every app to have a support page and a privacy policy on the web."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple kräver båda. E-postadressen visas öppet på sidorna, tillsammans med ditt namn om du har fyllt i kontaktuppgifterna. Du ansvarar för att policyn stämmer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple requires both. The email address is shown openly on the pages, together with your name if you have filled in the contact details. You answer for the policy being true."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple tar emot appen. Det tar oftast en kvart. Du kan stänga den här rutan under tiden.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple is receiving the app. That usually takes a quarter of an hour. You can close this in the meantime."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple tog inte emot appen än: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple did not take the app yet: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple vill veta vem de kan kontakta om appen. Fyll i det här en gång, så används det för alla dina appar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple wants to know who to contact about the app. Fill this in once, and it is used for all your apps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple visade inte vilket team kontot har. Fyll i ditt Team ID.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple did not show which team the account has. Fill in your Team ID."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple-utvecklarkonto": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple developer account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arbetar": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Working"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beskriv din första idé här ovanför, så dansar vi igång.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Describe your first idea above and we'll get dancing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beskriv din idé. Få en riktig iPhone-app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Describe your idea. Get a real iPhone app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beskriv vad du vill ändra eller lägga till": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Describe what you want to change or add"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beskrivning": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Description"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beskrivningen är för lång": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The description is too long"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bilden görs kvadratisk och används från nästa version du gör installerbar. Utan egen ikon får appen en enkel platshållare.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The picture is made square and used from the next version you make installable. Without an icon of its own the app gets a simple placeholder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bjud in mig som testare": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invite me as a tester"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bygg min app": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Build my app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bygger appen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Building the app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bygger för iPhone": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Building for iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bygget %@ är valt för versionen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Build %@ is selected for the version."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Böcker": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Books"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chatt": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dansar fram din app": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dancing your app into shape"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "De här väntar på att du skapar appen hos Apple. Välj bundle-id:t i listan när du skapar den.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These are waiting for you to create the app with Apple. Pick the bundle ID from the list when you create it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dela länken med andra": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Share the link with others"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Den senaste ändringen gick inte att bygga": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The latest change could not be built"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Det där är inte nyckelfilen från Apple. Den heter AuthKey_… och slutar på .p8.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That is not the key file from Apple. It is called AuthKey_… and ends in .p8."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Det ersätter texterna du har skrivit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This replaces the texts you have written."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Det finns redan ett konto med den e-postadressen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There is already an account with that email address."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Det gick inte att bjuda in dig. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You could not be invited. %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Det gick inte att nå Apple just nu. Försök igen om en stund.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple could not be reached right now. Try again in a while."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Det gick inte att nå servern. Kontrollera din uppkoppling.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server could not be reached. Check your connection."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Det gick inte att skicka in appen. Försök igen om en stund.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app could not be submitted. Try again in a while."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Det gick inte att skicka sidan. Försök igen om en stund.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The page could not be sent. Try again in a while."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Det gick inte att skriva ett förslag för den här appen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A suggestion could not be written for this app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Det gick inte att ta bilden. Försök igen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The picture could not be taken. Try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Det går inte att bjuda in testare just nu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Testers cannot be invited right now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Det här behöver rättas först:": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This has to be put right first:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Det här blev för stort för ett enda steg. Be om en mindre del i taget.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This became too large for a single step. Ask for a smaller part at a time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Det här går bara att göra i App Store Connect. Gör det där först:": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This can only be done in App Store Connect. Do it there first:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Det här kan jag tyvärr inte hjälpa till med. Prova att beskriva det på ett annat sätt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sorry, I cannot help with this. Try describing it another way."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Det är många som bygger just nu. Vänta en liten stund och försök igen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Many people are building right now. Wait a moment and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Din app sparas. Förhandsvisningen startar när en byggserver är ansluten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your app is saved. The preview starts when a build server is connected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dina appar": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your apps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dina appar laddas upp till ditt eget konto och publiceras i ditt namn.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your apps are uploaded to your own account and published in your name."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ditt konto får inte skicka appar till TestFlight.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your account is not allowed to send apps to TestFlight."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Du har inga appar än": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have no apps yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Du har nått dagens gräns för meddelanden. Välkommen tillbaka i morgon.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have reached today's message limit. Welcome back tomorrow."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Du har nått gränsen för antal appar. Ta bort en app för att skapa en ny.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have reached the limit on the number of apps. Delete one to create a new one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Du har redan så många skärmbilder som App Store tillåter. Ta bort en först.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You already have as many screenshots as the App Store allows. Remove one first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Du har ändringar som inte är sparade. De sparas innan sidan skickas.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have unsaved changes. They are saved before the page is sent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Du kan bli testare direkt, utan att vänta på Apples granskning. Då bjuds du in till tjänstens utvecklarkonto hos Apple, med tillgång till enbart din app. Du tackar ja i ett mejl från Apple.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can become a tester right away, without waiting for Apple's review. You are then invited to the service's developer account with Apple, with access to your app only. You accept in an email from Apple."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Du är testare": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You are a tester"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Du är testare i utvecklarkontot, så ingen granskning behövs. Öppna TestFlight-appen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You are a tester in the developer account, so no review is needed. Open the TestFlight app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Då ligger appen på hemskärmen som en vanlig app. Det går via Apples testapp TestFlight, som är gratis. Du behöver inget utvecklarkonto.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Then the app sits on the home screen like any other app. It goes through Apple's testing app TestFlight, which is free. You need no developer account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Döper appen till %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Naming the app %@"
          }
        }
